| Default Test | ✅ Clean — class name is descriptive |
| Redundant Print | ✅ Clean — no `Console.WriteLine` |
| Redundant Assertion | ✅ Clean — no `Assert.IsTrue(true)` |
| Resource Optimism | ✅ Clean — in-memory DB is self-contained |
| Empty Test | ✅ Clean |

